{
  "uid": "taskflow-messaging",
  "title": "TaskFlow Mensageria",
  "description": "Outbox, relay, consumer groups, lag e DLTs (Módulo 13). Provisionado por arquivo (grafana/dashboards/): mudanças via PR.",
  "tags": [
    "taskflow",
    "provisioned",
    "kafka"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "links": [],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Agora: os eventos estão fluindo?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Outbox: pendente mais antiga",
      "description": "Há quanto tempo o evento mais antigo espera o relay. Alerta OutboxStalled acima de 60 s por 2 min.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 14,
          "valueSize": 28
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(outbox_oldest_pending_age_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "idade"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Lag por consumer group",
      "description": "Mensagens que o grupo ainda não commitou, segundo o BROKER (kafka-exporter): sobe mesmo com o consumer parado. Alerta ConsumerLagHigh acima de 100 por 5 min.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 14,
          "valueSize": 28
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (consumergroup) (kafka_consumergroup_lag{topic=\"taskflow.task-events.v1\", consumergroup=~\"notifications|reports\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumergroup}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Mensagens nos DLTs",
      "description": "Mensagens retidas em cada dead-letter topic (30 dias). Cada uma é um efeito que não aconteceu: ver o redrive (13.6c) ou a reconstrução (13.6b).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 14,
          "valueSize": 28
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic=~\".+-dlt\\\\.v1\"} - kafka_topic_partition_oldest_offset{topic=~\".+-dlt\\\\.v1\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Processos no ar",
      "description": "up de cada processo coletado. Processo parado não exporta métrica nenhuma: o up é o sinal (alertas RelayDown e ConsumerDown).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "fora",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "no ar",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 14,
          "valueSize": 28
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=~\"taskflow-relay|taskflow-notifications|taskflow-reports|kafka\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Outbox e relay (Módulos 13.2 e 13.3)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Idade da pendente mais antiga",
      "description": "Lida do banco a cada coleta: se o loop do relay travar, continua crescendo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(outbox_oldest_pending_age_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "idade"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Pendentes na outbox",
      "description": "Tamanho da fila que o relay ainda não publicou.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(outbox_pending_messages)",
          "legendFormat": "pendentes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Publicadas e falhas por segundo",
      "description": "Vazão do relay e tentativas de lote que falharam (o lote inteiro volta).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(outbox_relay_published_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "publicadas/s"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(outbox_relay_failures_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "falhas/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Consumers (Módulos 13.4 a 13.6)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Mensagens por segundo, por grupo e resultado",
      "description": "Desfechos: processed, duplicate, ignored, ignored_replay, ignored_redrive, unknown_task, dead_lettered.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (consumer_group, result) (rate(kafka_consumer_messages_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumer_group}} · {{result}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Tentativas que falharam, por classe",
      "description": "infrastructure = banco fora (nunca vai ao DLT; alerta ConsumerDatabaseUnavailable); unknown = 5 tentativas e DLT; permanent = DLT na hora.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (consumer_group, error_class) (rate(kafka_consumer_retries_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumer_group}} · {{error_class}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Tempo de processamento (p95)",
      "description": "Idempotência + efeito, por mensagem. Buckets em segundos, de 1 ms a 10 s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, consumer_group) (rate(kafka_consumer_processing_duration_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumer_group}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Lag por grupo e partição",
      "description": "Partição parada (mensagem em retry, banco fora) aparece como uma linha subindo sozinha.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "taskflow-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (consumergroup, partition) (kafka_consumergroup_lag{topic=\"taskflow.task-events.v1\", consumergroup=~\"notifications|reports\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumergroup}} · p{{partition}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
